  "title": "Tuna pate with smoked salmon",
  "description": null,
  "editorial": {
    "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Delicious Tuna and Smoked Salmon&nbsp;Pate is an amazing appetizer served with fresh or toasted bread. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:wp-recipe-maker/recipe {\"id\":21420,\"template\":\"chic-template-english\",\"updated\":1640816542306} -->\n<!--WPRM Recipe 21420-->\n<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe\">\n\t<h2 class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-name\">Tuna pate with smoked salmon</h2>\n\t<img class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-image\" src=\"https://mycafegourmand.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/IMG_4363.Blog_-150x150.png\"/>\t<p class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-summary\">\n\t\t\t</p>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-equipment\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-ingredients\">\n\t\t<ul><li>160 g tuna in water (drained)</li><li>5-6 slices smoked salmon</li><li>160 g mascarpone cheese</li><li>1/2 onion ( chopped)</li><li>salt and pepper (to taste)</li><li>fresh dill (to taste )</li></ul>\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-instructions\">\n\t\t<ol><li>In a bowl, combine together mascarpone cheese and tuna, mash it with fork.</li><li>Add chopped dill and minced onion, salt and pepper.  </li><li>Add finely chopped smoked salmon and stir together.  </li><li>Transfer to a small dish and garnish with chopped fresh dill or with thin slices of salmon. Cover with food plastic wrap.</li><li>Chill in the fridge for at least 6 hours.  </li></ol>\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-notes\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-meta\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-meta-course\">Appetizers</div>\t</div>\n</div>\n<!--End WPRM Recipe-->\n<!-- /wp:wp-recipe-maker/recipe -->",
    "excerpt": null
  },
